# PDFForge

PDFForge is a shipping product. Keep the editor and engine production-quality.

- Do not use Nx
- Do not add a database
- Do not send PDFs to external services

Canonical skills:

- `skills/rust-pdf-engine/SKILL.md`
- `skills/angular-editor/SKILL.md`

Forbidden for text editing: white rectangle plus overlay text. Edit content streams instead.
